    title: "resolution state smuggled into the evidence_type axis via ast_call (98.5% unresolved) vs ast_call_direct (8.3%) — call-family label redundantly encodes is_resolved"  # 9a92
    status: todo_hard  # 9a92
    priority: 3  # 9a92
    parent:  # 9a92
    tags:  # 9a92
    - dogfood_tranch_04  # 9a92
